/* Static authority shells whose deterministic decisions live in one pure
 * service island. Consumer defines HOTSHADOW_OWNER(shell_tu, service_tu).
 *
 * The shell is compile-checked but never loaded or activated. The service is
 * compiled as a proposal and its resident-frozen KAT runs in a disposable
 * fork. This is coverage routing, never runtime authority. */

